41qiaX3Ml066psGppcdhAqEw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/TvpseicuBVhpDnHCAIsQiaCCTlKB6hh60jjMXkH3MAelL00R5TEzaI1RAvMcja594E8ptfjhpOAfZ089JcoFz9IQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/TvpseicuBVhpDnHCAIsQiaCCTlKB6hh60jYRWexht3DAGAc2iar7gKPS0fdzezyJiaIuU93FA26iastw479jyrQFInA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>左右滑动，查看更多</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/TvpseicuBVhpDnHCAIsQiaCCTlKB6hh60j6iaNIogUFqicoAZ1HCew3K5uhxcf7ne99ibRvzyx6tKiapLKX2d4qQs9JQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、夏令营费用</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/TvpseicuBVhpDnHCAIsQiaCCTlKB6hh60jxVwyRCI3s4WPLsiaygiaJAa4LFbX2wLgazz6tHVrrvBAd7kq9PFHHibYg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>夏令营不收取任何费用，营员交通和食宿自理</span><span>，根据营员本科高校所在地，按照以下标准一次性给予来校的交通食宿补贴：（1）温州市内：200元/人；（2）浙江省内（除温州市）：500元/人；（3）华东地区（除浙江省）：800元/人；（4）华南、华中、华北地区：1000元/人；（5）东北、西北、西南地区：1200元/人。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/TvpseicuBVhpDnHCAIsQiaCCTlKB6hh60j6iaNIogUFqicoAZ1HCew3K5uhxcf7ne99ibRvzyx6tKiapLKX2d4qQs9JQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、其他</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/TvpseicuBVhpDnHCAIsQiaCCTlKB6hh60jxVwyRCI3s4WPLsiaygiaJAa4LFbX2wLgazz6tHVrrvBAd7kq9PFHHibYg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）一志愿报考我校或通过推免的方式被我校录取的合格营员入学当年可享受一等学业奖学金（1.2万元/生·年）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）若发现申请材料有虚假成分，即取消申请人一切由此获得的利益，并保留追溯的权利。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）参加暑期夏令营的学生必须遵守温州医科大学及我院的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动，并注意安全。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营活动，擅自离营者，举办方将取消相关补助。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（五）人在异乡请务必注意人身和财物安全。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（六）请确认准确的联系方式，并保持通讯设备畅通，以便及时联系。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（七）学院联系方式：</span></span></p><p><span><span>教育教学部</span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询电话：0577-88068950</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：陈老师</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span>大学生暑期活动报名表获取请点击文末阅读原文</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>                     <span>            </span><span>视觉健康全国重点实验室</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>温州医科大学眼视光学院（生物医学工程学院）、附属眼视光医院</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/TvpseicuBVhpDnHCAIsQiaCCTlKB6hh60jHu61mJNMyTElxWqwEoRhKx5p1g8Fu0am5slArAKRza5n4mI43VbsNw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><em><span><span>筑梦眼视光，一起向未来</span></span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>更多故事，期待与你相遇</span></em></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/TvpseicuBVhpDnHCAIsQiaCCTlKB6hh60jHKhibgvQ5EWjcdufPXEcV8ib4oFv1LTWYcnfQMZANjcspiby6gAwNsRyg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>来源：眼视光教学资源共享平台</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7f10e7500731dee288121b71bc162b3aaec9a98208faaaff111be1362c001da8","textLength":1768,"sourceSha256":"2717f88cab4f136b3ba01001b8b7f491620d4990145dae2405201653e63ed511","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ffdf8aaa3a9b7621b1dc","title":"2025年温州医科大学眼视光学院（生物医学工程学院）视觉健康全国重点实验室全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:15.942676+00:00"}
